(title_block (title "Charger and battery path") (date "2026-10-25") (rev "A") (company "The OpenDAP Project") (comment 1 "blk.charger") (comment 2 "TPS2121 input mux, BQ25798 2S charger, ship FET, fuse and the six battery contacts"))
(lib_symbols )
(text_box "Notes\n1. Function: TPS2121 picks USB-C (IN1, priority) or the HAT port (IN2) into VBUS_CHG; the\n   BQ25798 charges the 2S pack and makes VSYS (6.0-8.8 V); the ship FET (SDRV) and the 5 A fuse\n   join the BQ25798 BAT node to the six battery contacts (feature blocks #7; ADR 0014, 0020).\n2. Absent state: never omitted. Pack out: with no adapter the BQ25798 is unpowered and the ship\n   FET off, so an inserted pack meets a soft start; with an adapter it reports no battery.\n3. Drawn on three sub-sheets (blk.charger-*), sheets of blk.charger as the SoC's sub-sheets.\n4. SYS leaves as VSYS_SRC; the VSYS INA236 shunt (10 mΩ, blk.current-monitors) makes VSYS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 140.97 0) (size 129.54 20.32) (margins 1.905 1.905 1.905 1.905) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2f721567-8d2b-5eff-a8d1-fb0f2110fc36"))
